        "name": "USN-8740-1",
        "description": "Weeraphat Srisutham discovered that the .NET watch BrowserRefreshServer did not properly validate cross-origin WebSocket connections. An attacker could possibly use this issue to expose sensitive information. (CVE-2026-58649)  Rajesh Chada discovered that the .NET watch AspireServerService improperly exposed information through the use of certain arguments. An attacker could possibly use this issue to elevate privileges and execute arbitrary code. (CVE-2026-69806)",
